        "@value": "Step right up and sing along to the smash-hit movie musical The Greatest Showman! Featuring unforgettable songs like ‘This Is Me,’ ‘A Million Dreams,’ and ‘The Greatest Show,’ this special screening invites audiences to belt out every lyric together."
      }
    ],
